  "description": "Provides robust authentication and identity management for TuanZi applications, featuring:\n\t\t\t- Full integration with ASP.NET Core Identity\n\t\t\t- Custom user and role store implementations\n\t\t\t- Repository pattern support for data access\n\t\t\t- Multi-factor authentication support\n\t\t\t- External provider integration (OAuth/OpenID Connect)\n\t\t\t- Policy-based authorization foundation\n\t\t\t- Token-based authentication services\n\t\t\t- User management API surfaces\n\t\t\t- Seamless integration with TuanZi permission system",
